     <P align=center><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018091815551806.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018091815551897.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018091815551875.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018091815551815.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018091815551889.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018091815551872.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR><IMG onmousewheel="return bbimg(this)" border=0 hspace=0 alt="" src="/Shaoxingyizhong/UploadFiles/UploadFiles/201809/2018091815551898.jpg" onload=resizepic(this)><BR><BR></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">读万卷书，行万里路，人类知识的汲取从来不限于存放在图书馆的典籍，更是书写在内心，镌刻在灵魂，深藏于精神之气，而旅行则是丰富自我的不二选择。地因人盛，文以学扬。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>18</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年暑期，</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>27</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">名一中学子抵达德国，开始了放眼世界的筑梦之旅。</SPAN><B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><?xml:namespace prefix = o ns = "urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" /><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">住德国家庭，悟欧洲文化</SPAN></B><B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></B></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">德国算是欧洲一颗耀眼的明珠，和我们结对的是</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>Speyer</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">一所叫尼古拉斯·冯·维斯的高级文理中学。很幸运能认识德国朋友，在温馨的住家家庭度上一段美妙的时光，这也成了此次欧洲之旅最深的记忆。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">在欧洲流传一句名言，“法国人为吃饭而生活，德国人为生活而吃饭”，虽无关褒贬，却十分形象。德国人的采购时间一般集中于每周六，而这也是接下来一周的饮食来源。因而，德国饮食很简单，无外乎面包、薯条、鸡翅、牛肉，偶尔来点水果和蔬菜，可以说很单调，却也富于规律，一如冷静严谨的德国作风。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">在娱乐设施方面，德国崇尚一体化、完整化和自然化。与国内公园有所不同，德国的公园似乎更具多功能，不仅有供人休息的草坪，还有一些零散的植物园和动物园。水族馆的陈列更是如此。国内一般都是一个水族箱里养殖一种鱼类，而在德国，一个大大的水族箱内，水草、虾类、鱼类、珊瑚礁等组成了一条完整的生物链。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><SPAN style="mso-spacerun: yes">     </SPAN><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24.1pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">平行时空里的“诗与远方”</SPAN></B><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">纵然在饮食、生活甚至教育方面都存在巨大差异，在远在万里之外的平行世界里，却也有着同样的群体与我们肩负着同样的使命，探索着同样的“诗与远方”，那就是汲取知识的给养。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">德国的授课模式，无疑令我们这些中国学生大为吃惊。他们没有固定教室或座位，一节课只有十个学生左右，课堂容量不大，一天的课程量也很少。课堂上，学生各抒己见，大胆提问，师生互动明显，气氛相当活跃，即使存在语言障碍，我们也在一定程度上被对方的积极性所感染。德国同学告诉我们，相比于考试，老师更关注学生的思维。如果课堂表现不佳，就会得到很低的分数。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">德国上学看似轻松，实则不然。德方教导主任曾向介绍起德国的教育体制。在德国，考取一所顶尖大学，同样需要出类拔萃的成绩。而且，与中国的授课模式不同，德国学生需有更出色的自我学习、自我管理和自我探究能力。他们也有作业不设置标准答案，但更偏向于合作研究，耗时长，需考虑因素多样，对学生提出更高的要求。而另一方面，德国虽崇尚</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>“</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">开放、包容</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>”</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">的教育理念，但在升学环节上，其公正性和残酷性绝不亚于中国的高考选拔机制。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">东西教育差别在于模式和体制，其理念和内核却是共通的，那就是培养优秀的、全面发展的全球化精英人才。因此，从这一角度来说，中德学子面临着相同的“诗与远方”。无论于谁，诗都是痛苦的，远方都是泥泞的，最美的部分是追逐，是奋斗，是汲取与充实。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">一星期很短，游历领略到的不过是欧洲的一鳞半爪；一星期也很长，于学子们而言，与结对家庭的跨国友谊，对欧洲文化的探索认知，都不可谓不珍贵，不可谓不丰满。那么，就挥一挥衣袖，撷走莱茵河上空最美丽的云彩。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p> </o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">【学校简介】</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">尼古拉斯·冯·维斯高级文理中学（</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>Nikolaus von Weis Gymnasium Speyer</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">）位于德国莱茵兰普法尔茨州的重要城市施佩耶尔市（</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>Speyer</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">）。作为德国著名的一所高级文理中学，该校教学名望甚高，教育氛围浓厚。学校成立于</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>1953</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年，现有学生</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>700</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">多名</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>, </SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">教师</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>63</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">位，所有教师具备德国国家硕士或博士学位。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>2016</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">年</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US>2</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 宋体; FONT-SIZE: 12pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 'Times New Roman'; mso-hansi-font-family: 'Times New Roman'">月，该校被德国文教部授予莱茵兰普法尔茨州的“欧洲学校”这一光荣称号，用于表彰学校在创意活动、交流项目、外语教学等方面取得的卓越成绩。为了使学生放眼世界，增加社会阅历，学校极其注重国际交流，现已同英国、法国、西班牙、以色列等多个国家的学校建立了友好关系，每年有上百名学生参与国际交流活动。</SPAN><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-FAMILY: 'Times New Roman','serif'; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; TEXT-INDENT: 24pt; MARGIN: 0cm 0cm 0pt; mso-char-indent-count: 2.0" class=MsoNormal><SPAN style="LINE-HEIGHT: 150%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt" lang=EN-US><o:p><FONT face=Calibri> </FONT></o:p></SPAN></P>
<P align=center> </P>
    
